---
import Masthead from '../components/Masthead.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Origins | The Chronicle">
  <article id="origins-newspaper" class="newspaper-wrapper">
    <Masthead />
    <section id="content" class="content-wrapper">
      <div id="section-1" class="section-1">
        <div id="sidebar" class="sidebar">
          <div id="figure-container" class="figure-container">
            <img id="figure-1" src="/images/newspaper-portrait.jpg" alt="A vintage computer setup" />
            <p id="figure-1-caption" class="figure-1-caption">
              Fig 1.0: Early computing setup, circa 1980s. The dawn of the digital age.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div id="tech-stack-container" class="tech-stack-container">
            <h3 id="technology-heading" class="technology-heading">Foundational Tech</h3>
            <div id="core-logic" class="core-logic">
              <p>Early Logic <span class="technology">assembly</span> <span class="technology">fortran</span><span class="technology">cobol</span></p>
            </div>
            <div id="interfaces" class="interfaces">
              <p>Interfaces <span class="technology">cli</span><span class="technology">crt</span><span class="technology">punch cards</span></p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div id="article" class="article">
          <div id="headline-container" class="headline-container">
            <p id="tagline" class="tagline">// Historical Exclusive</p>
            <h1 id="headline" class="headline">Tracing the Digital Roots</h1>
            <p id="headline-quote" class="headline-quote">"Every great journey begins with a single byte."</p>
          </div>
          <div id="lead-story-container" class="lead-story-container">
            <div class="lead-story-col">
              <p class="lead-story drop-cap">
                Before the sleek interfaces and ubiquitous connectivity, there was a nascent digital world,
                forged in the crucible of scientific curiosity and military necessity. This page delves into
                the foundational moments that shaped the technological landscape we inhabit today.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="lead-story-col">
              <p class="lead-story">
                From the earliest mechanical calculators to the first electronic computers, the path was
                paved by visionaries who dared to imagine machines that could process information at speeds
                unimaginable to their predecessors.
              </p>
              <p class="lead-story">
                The very concept of a "program" was revolutionary, allowing complex tasks to be automated
                and repeated with precision.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="lead-story-col">
              <p class="lead-story">
                The evolution from vacuum tubes to transistors, and then to integrated circuits, marked
                exponential leaps in capability and miniaturization, setting the stage for personal computing.
              </p>
              <p class="lead-story">
                This chronicle aims to connect the dots, illustrating how the seemingly disparate
                innovations of the past converged to create the digital present.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .newspaper-wrapper {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }

  .masthead {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 2rem 0;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .edition-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .edition-meta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  /* Home Page: Content */
  .content-wrapper {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .section-1 {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: flex-start;
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-bottom: 3rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .section-1 {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }

  .article {
    flex: 1;
    gap: 1;
    padding: 0 2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .sidebar {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    border-right: 2px solid var(--ink);
    padding: 0 1.5rem 0 0;
    flex: 0 0 300px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .sidebar {
      flex: none;
      width: 100%;
      border-right: none;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink);
    }
  }

  .figure-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: left;
    padding-bottom: 3rem;
    border-bottom: 3px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .figure-container img {
    border: 4px solid var(--ink);
    padding: 3px;
  }
  .figure-container p {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 8pt;
  }

  .headline-container {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink);
    padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .drop-cap::first-letter {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 72pt;
    float: left;
    line-height: 0.6;
    padding-bottom: 1.8rem;
    margin-right: 8px;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 900;
  }
  .lead-story-container {
    display: flex;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .lead-story-container {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
  }

  .lead-story-col {
    flex: 1;
    text-align: justify;
    padding: 0 1rem;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .lead-story-col:first-child {
    border-left: none;
  }

  .lead-story {
    font-family: serif;
    font-weight: 100;
    font-size: 14pt;
  }

  .tagline {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 9pt;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .headline {
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 78pt;
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .headline-quote {
    text-transform: capitalize;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 18pt;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    color: #858585;
  }

  .technology-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .technology {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12pt;
    border: 1px solid var(--ink);
  }
</style>